From cd5c260102d28c891f200a976f342c3da89e701b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <dev@infoverify.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 10:14:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add animated service badges to LoginPage (Data, Airtime, BVN
 - no NIN)

Three floating decorative badges positioned around the login card,
echoing the reference screenshot's illustration in spirit (a visual
that says "here's what this app does") without copying real people
photos - built as CSS-animated icon badges in MARIA's own brand
instead, which is also copyright-safe.

- Data Purchase (Wifi icon), Airtime Topup (Smartphone icon), BVN
  Verification (Fingerprint icon). NIN deliberately left out per
  instruction.
- Gentle bob-and-tilt animation (index.css: auth-badge-float
  keyframe), staggered per badge via inline animationDelay so the
  three don't move in lockstep. Reuses the existing blanket
  prefers-reduced-motion override already in this file, so it's
  automatically disabled for anyone with that OS setting - no extra
  code needed.
- aria-hidden on each badge - purely decorative, shouldn't be read out
  by a screen reader or land in tab order.
- Responsive: Data Purchase shows from md, Airtime/BVN from lg - none
  of them render on a phone-width screen, so they never crowd the
  actual form. The card gained an explicit z-10 to stack above them
  regardless.

Verified: frontend tsc clean, vite build succeeds.
---
 web/src/index.css           |  9 ++++++
 web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx | 57 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/web/src/index.css b/web/src/index.css
index 2f22ef1..b4dfcc0 100644
--- a/web/src/index.css
+++ b/web/src/index.css
@@ -78,6 +78,15 @@ select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
 .ticker-row:hover .ticker-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
 .dashboard-overview { animation: dashboard-float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
 @keyframes dashboard-float { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-8px); } }
+
+/* Gentle bob + gentle rotate for the decorative service badges on the
+   auth pages (LoginPage, RegisterPage) - each badge gets its own
+   animation-delay inline so the three don't move in lockstep. */
+@keyframes auth-badge-float {
+  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(var(--badge-tilt, -3deg)); }
+  50%      { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(var(--badge-tilt, -3deg)); }
+}
+.auth-badge { animation: auth-badge-float 4.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
 .service-tile {
   isolation: isolate;
   border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, .35);
diff --git a/web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx b/web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx
index 49f9630..b105faf 100644
--- a/web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx
+++ b/web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx
